            "content": "[Unit]\nDescription=Grafana dashboard (systemd-managed container)\nAfter=sut-pod.service\nRequires=sut-pod.service\n\n[Container]\nImage=docker.io/grafana/grafana:11.5.0\nPull=newer\nPod=sut.pod\nEnvironment=GF_SECURITY_ADMIN_USER=admin\nEnvironment=GF_SECURITY_ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin\nEnvironment=GF_USERS_ALLOW_SIGN_UP=false\n\n[Service]\nRestart=always\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=sut-pod.service",
