            "content": "[Unit]\nDescription=OWASP Juice Shop web application (systemd-managed container)\nAfter=sut-pod.service\nRequires=sut-pod.service\n\n[Container]\nImage=docker.io/bkimminich/juice-shop:latest\nPull=newer\nPod=sut.pod\nEnvironment=MQTT_BROKER_URL=mqtt://127.0.0.1:1883\nHealthCmd=/nodejs/bin/node -e \"require('http').get('http://127.0.0.1:3000/',r=\u003eprocess.exit(r.statusCode\u003e=200\u0026\u0026r.statusCode\u003c500?0:1)).on('error',()=\u003eprocess.exit(1))\"\nHealthInterval=30s\n\n[Service]\nRestart=always\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=sut-pod.service",
